b3901e-dead-5668-82f2-f029bbf33098" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{x}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781/field-5/0e81a94db950bf13e0d601283871e2ba0b2d5c2975f19553304fb06c0cac7e57" :answer/id #uuid "e18b7291-d56d-5331-a29d-3b4c944b15ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{x}^{5}\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781/field-5/bb8195c683cc449468d077fe1f8b1f5555c7fd1a5186eeaad1bf969ac0bc30c5" :answer/id #uuid "b288d63c-87d5-5721-b2e7-f3e90843af1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{x}^{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781/field-5/50afc5239b697bdd3b89c7dceaa468bbb16e86ebc039bf01394428bdc768bfdf" :answer/id #uuid "fa461bfd-c6ac-5f0d-beb4-b3602cc9fb42" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }{x}^{5}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(3x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781/field-5/a8fd8110c299c02853ce7762c5cda04b846abfd4384dabea2785d45788d3996d" :answer/id #uuid "1e9e4e6f-c5a4-5dd4-acf1-9377ed327829" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{\\int }_{-4}^{4}{x}^{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}x)\\,\\text{d}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781/field-5" :answer-field/id #uuid "10692562-b0ad-5e24-8cc2-12e18882dfc7" :answer-field/key "field-5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-341781/field-5/a8fd8110c299c02853ce7762c5cda04b846abfd4384dabea2785d45788d3996d" :answer-field/choices ["q-341781/field-5/88630938a0b541bd9cc636b98a8da5c1489acb86fad2332f9e45071f73472054" "q-341781/field-5/c6431128976270992d605fce909620d06072bef0ee02128519f0d89c290cfe2c" "q-341781/field-5/0e81a94db950bf13e0d601283871e2ba0b2d5c2975f19553304fb06c0cac7e57" "q-341781/field-5/bb8195c683cc449468d077fe1f8b1f5555c7fd1a5186eeaad1bf969ac0bc30c5" "q-341781/field-5/50afc5239b697bdd3b89c7dceaa468bbb16e86ebc039bf01394428bdc768bfdf" "q-341781/field-5/a8fd8110c299c02853ce7762c5cda04b846abfd4384dabea2785d45788d3996d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-341781" :question/id #uuid "5bf2da3a-65c2-56bd-9bae-c452bd642a05" :question/math-academy-id "q-341781" :question/problem "Let $f(x)$ be the $2L$-periodic extension of a function $F(x)$ from $x\\in [-L,L)$ to $x\\in R.$\nSelect the correct options in the reasoning below.The Fourier series of $f$ is given by\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡({{field-1}})+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡({{field-2}}).\n$$\n\nThe $3$rd sine coefficient of the series is\n\n$$\n{b}_{3}={{field-3}}.\n$$\n\nGiven that $F(x)={x}^{5}$ and $L=4,$ the $3$rd sine coefficient becomes\n\n$$\n{b}_{3}={{field-4}}\\,\\cdot \\,{{field-5}}.\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Recall that multiplying the argument of a function by $k\\ne 0$ represents the horizontal stretching of the corresponding graph by a factor of $\\frac{1}{k}.$\n\nNow, let $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x.$ Then, since $f(x)$ has a period of $2L,$ the function\n\n$$\ng(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\n$$\n\nmust have a period of $2L\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}=2\\pi .$ \n\nThe Fourier series of $g(s)$ is\n\n$$\ng(s)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns),\n$$\n\nwhere:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{a}_{0} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\ {a}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{cos}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1 \\\\ {b}_{n} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(ns)\\,\\text{d}s,\\,n\\ge 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting $s=\\frac{\\pi }{L}x$ and using the fact that $g(s)=f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s),$ we get the Fourier series of $f(x):$\n\n$$\nf(x)∼\\frac{{a}_{0}}{2}+{\\sum }_{n=1}^{\\infty }{a}_{n}\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)+{b}_{n}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x)\n$$\n\nTherefore, $3$rd sine coefficient of $f(x)$ is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }g(s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-\\pi }^{\\pi }f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }s)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3s)\\,\\text{d}s \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(\\frac{L}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(3\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}(\\frac{\\pi }{L}x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\pi }\\cdot \\frac{\\pi }{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{L}{\\int }_{-L}^{L}f(x)\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{L}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $L=4$ and $f(x)={x}^{5},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{b}_{3} & =\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot {\\int }_{-4}^{4}{x}^{5}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\pi }{4}x)\\,\\text{d}x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-341781/field-1" "q-341781/field-2" "q-341781/field-3" "q-341781/field-4" "q-341781/field-5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "12ff3452-19b6-566a-8b39-ad880dee8858"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-341781"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-341776/field-1/7784087e23165dffd3b112724e1fa7fce6fac80abd850f7d34d288aa280953a5" :answer/id #uuid "668c27d5-2841-59da-8a63-2633e5795094" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{L}x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341776/field-1/cdec8cc80924fdc54544a538540660c85f7b1a62e92a417e4a5e6cfb2daee4b1" :answer/id #uuid "28073958-afed-5bec-affa-659202902b69" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{n}{L\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341776/field-1/a92f7ee75851e2263770df8a12763f4813f0228b01859171856ea4c0d4aa61e9" :answer/id #uuid "0221d97c-b463-5293-bbac-eb7447b306c4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{L}{n\\pi }x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-341776/field-1/a9c